{"version":3,"createdAt":1791627001150,"mainModel":{"schemaVersion":8,"id":"cm_mv287zmd","key":"cm_mv287zmd","name":"Planchard Chapter5 - review Q1-Q19 - browser 2026-10-10","kind":"part","authoringMode":"fully-parametric","localFrame":{"origin":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":0},"xAxis":{"x":1,"y":0,"z":0},"yAxis":{"x":0,"y":1,"z":0},"zAxis":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":1}},"references":[{"id":"origin","type":"origin","name":"Origin","origin":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":0}},{"id":"plane:top","type":"plane","name":"Top Plane","origin":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":0},"normal":{"x":0,"y":1,"z":0},"xAxis":{"x":1,"y":0,"z":0}},{"id":"plane:front","type":"plane","name":"Front Plane","origin":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":0},"normal":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":1},"xAxis":{"x":1,"y":0,"z":0}},{"id":"plane:right","type":"plane","name":"Right Plane","origin":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":0},"normal":{"x":1,"y":0,"z":0},"xAxis":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":1}},{"id":"axis:x","type":"axis","name":"X Axis","origin":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":0},"direction":{"x":1,"y":0,"z":0}},{"id":"axis:y","type":"axis","name":"Y Axis","origin":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":0},"direction":{"x":0,"y":1,"z":0}},{"id":"axis:z","type":"axis","name":"Z Axis","origin":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":0},"direction":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":1}}],"parameters":{},"sketches":[{"id":"sk_3eonl","name":"X·Z sketch","plane":"top","offset":0,"referenceId":"plane:top","points":[],"entities":[],"constraints":[],"diagnostics":[],"status":"fully-defined"}],"features":[],"history":[{"id":"history:sketch:sk_3eonl","kind":"sketch","targetId":"sk_3eonl","name":"X·Z sketch","suppressed":false,"status":"rebuilt"}],"parts":[],"assemblies":[],"appearances":[],"notes":[],"markups":[],"rules":{},"metadata":{"authoringSystem":"parametric-v1"},"topologyBindings":[],"namedSelections":[],"revision":1,"lastRebuild":{"ok":true,"signature":"{\"definitionId\":\"cm_mv287zmd\",\"features\":[],\"history\":[{\"id\":\"history:sketch:sk_3eonl\",\"kind\":\"sketch\",\"suppressed\":false,\"targetId\":\"sk_3eonl\"}],\"overrides\":{},\"revision\":1,\"sketches\":[{\"constraints\":[],\"entities\":[],\"id\":\"sk_3eonl\",\"name\":\"X·Z sketch\",\"offset\":0,\"plane\":\"top\",\"points\":[],\"referenceId\":\"plane:top\"}]}","issues":[],"rebuiltAt":1791626985776},"price":500,"col":"#c9bfae","constraints":[],"rollback":null,"activeSketch":"sk_3eonl","variables":[],"referenceGeometry":[{"id":"plane:top","type":"reference_plane","name":"Top Plane","origin":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":0},"normal":{"x":0,"y":1,"z":0},"xAxis":{"x":1,"y":0,"z":0}},{"id":"plane:front","type":"reference_plane","name":"Front Plane","origin":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":0},"normal":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":1},"xAxis":{"x":1,"y":0,"z":0}},{"id":"plane:right","type":"reference_plane","name":"Right Plane","origin":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":0},"normal":{"x":1,"y":0,"z":0},"xAxis":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":1}},{"id":"axis:x","type":"reference_axis","name":"X Axis","origin":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":0},"direction":{"x":1,"y":0,"z":0}},{"id":"axis:y","type":"reference_axis","name":"Y Axis","origin":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":0},"direction":{"x":0,"y":1,"z":0}},{"id":"axis:z","type":"reference_axis","name":"Z Axis","origin":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":0},"direction":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":1}}],"definitionId":"cm_mv287zmd","documentVersion":1,"context":{"kind":"part","units":{"length":"mm","angle":"deg","mass":"kg","precision":3},"activeCoordinateSystemId":"origin"},"customProperties":{"Description":"Source printed5-38-39 / PDF256-257, Planchard2021 Chapter5 review Q1-Q19. Independent source-grounded explanations of part templates, planar sketches, features, dimensional units, constraint colors and geometry; feature/sketch icon identifications from the actual source pictures. Ordinary browser Drawing notes; no official answer-key, newly authored CAD or certification claim."},"drawing":{"version":1,"draftingStandard":"custom","secondaryUnits":"","secondaryPrecision":2,"size":"A3","orientation":"landscape","projection":"third","units":"mm","scale":"fit","showHidden":true,"showCenters":true,"showZones":true,"views":[],"dims":[],"notes":[{"id":"nv20ogbj","x":34.755904449194375,"y":24.64126801587906,"text":"CHAPTER5 - REVIEW ANSWERS Q1-Q19\nSource: printed5-38/39 / PDF256/257, Planchard2021.\nIndependent explanations and source icon identifications.\nNo official answer-key, authored CAD or certification claim.","leader":null},{"id":"nd0wgfrp","x":34.755904449194375,"y":59.6884669389522,"text":"Q1 - Four features\nExtruded Boss/Base adds material by extending a profile;Fillet rounds\nselected edges/faces;Chamfer bevels an edge;Extruded Cut removes material\nusing a profile and end condition.","leader":null},{"id":"nlxm4jif","x":34.755904449194375,"y":78.71410309387437,"text":"Q2 - Template versus part\nA template stores starting defaults such as units,standard and document\nproperties; a part document stores the particular model and its\nfeature/sketch history. Book extensions:.prtdot versus.sldprt.","leader":null},{"id":"nzqdk9ju","x":34.755904449194375,"y":97.73972091355554,"text":"Q3 - Start session\nBook workflow:launch SOLIDWORKS,choose File→New,select a Part template,then\nchoose a sketch plane/face. ModelForge equivalent is opening the local app\nand creating a new Model document; do not claim the original\nexecutable/menu was exercised.","leader":null},{"id":"nz8dwn2q","x":34.755904449194375,"y":120.27006504287839,"text":"Q4 - New2D sketch\nSelect a plane/planar face,start Sketch,draw entities,apply relations and\ndimensions to express intent,finish the sketch,and create the required\nfeature.","leader":null},{"id":"nnovpeng","x":34.755904449194375,"y":139.29568286255957,"text":"Q5 - Inches to millimeters\nBook:change document units in Options→Document Properties→Units or the\ndocument units control,using MMGS. A unit change converts numerical display\nand does not physically rescale the part.","leader":null},{"id":"nxwf3wlp","x":34.755904449194375,"y":158.32131901748173,"text":"Q6 - Default planes\nFront,Top,Right.","leader":null},{"id":"ne1vnq0x","x":34.755904449194375,"y":170.33750255312057,"text":"Q7 - Base feature\nThe first solid-producing feature on which later features depend,e.g.a\nrectangle extruded into a block.","leader":null},{"id":"nckg307y","x":34.755904449194375,"y":185.8583940631601,"text":"Q8 - Boss/cut/fillet\nBoss adds profile-derived volume;Cut removes profile-derived volume;Fillet\nrounds an existing edge/transition.","leader":null},{"id":"n09rm2ys","x":34.755904449194375,"y":201.3793039084406,"text":"Q9 - Black sketch\nFully defined in the book's default sketch-color convention.","leader":null},{"id":"n57l1njk","x":34.755904449194375,"y":213.39548744407944,"text":"Q10 - Blue sketch\nUnder defined:one or more degrees of freedom remain.","leader":null},{"id":"ndtl9i9m","x":225.01213765172912,"y":59.6884669389522,"text":"Q11 - Red/yellow sketch\nOver defined or conflicting/problem geometry in the source convention.\nExamine diagnostics rather than treating color alone as a solved sketch.","leader":null},{"id":"ngn1vbco","x":225.01213765172912,"y":75.2093767842327,"text":"Q12 - Folders only store part files\nFalse. FeatureManager folders organize features/items; document folders may\ncontain multiple file types.","leader":null},{"id":"nq323he3","x":225.01213765172912,"y":90.73028662951322,"text":"Q13 - Symmetric relation\nPaired entities have reflected positions/geometry about a construction\ncenterline; moving one preserves symmetry of its partner.","leader":null},{"id":"ncez3vv3","x":225.01213765172912,"y":106.25117813955274,"text":"Q14 - Angular dimension\nA dimension that controls or reports the included angle between suitable\nlines/entities,or an entity's angle to a reference.","leader":null},{"id":"nlj7q10a","x":225.01213765172912,"y":121.77208798483323,"text":"Q15 - Draft angle\nA taper on walls relative to the pull direction,facilitating mold release.\nExample:a molded container whose walls narrow toward one end.","leader":null},{"id":"n0my7svm","x":225.01213765172912,"y":137.29299783011373,"text":"Q16 - Arc points\nThree defining points for the source arc constructions:3-point arc uses two\nends and a point on the arc;centerpoint arc uses center,start,end. A\ntangent-arc interaction additionally derives its initial tangent from\nexisting geometry.","leader":null},{"id":"n6l32wzp","x":225.01213765172912,"y":159.8233419594366,"text":"Q17 - Multi-body part\nOne part document contains separate solid bodies,which can be operated on\nwith body/feature scope and later combined or saved separately. It is not\nautomatically an assembly of independently mated components.","leader":null},{"id":"n7m8r5o1","x":225.01213765172912,"y":178.84895977911776,"text":"Q18 - Feature iconsA–F\nA Extruded Boss/Base;B Linear Pattern;C Draft;D Shell;E Revolved\nBoss/Base;F Mirror. Source PDF257 rendered and visually inspected,not\nidentified from OCR symbols.","leader":null},{"id":"n6rz6k6m","x":225.01213765172912,"y":197.87457759879894,"text":"Q19 - Sketch iconsA–J\nA Line;B Smart Dimension;C Centerline;D Circle;E Corner Rectangle;F Offset\nEntities;G Tangent Arc;H Convert Entities;I Point;J Polygon. Source PDF257\nvisually inspected;G cross-checked against the source arc flyout on PDF274.","leader":null}],"primitives":[],"title":{"revision":"A","sheet":1,"sheets":1,"title":"CHAPTER5 - REVIEW Q1-Q19","number":"PLANCHARD5-38/39-PDF256/257","author":"","company":"","material":"","finish":"","mass":"","date":"2026-10-10","tolerance":""},"seeded":true},"lastStandardsAudit":{"at":1791626897384,"ok":true,"checked":0,"blocking":[]},"exactTopologyCache":{}},"assemblies":[],"drawings":[],"metadata":{"generator":"ModelForge CAD SolidWorks-Class","units":"mm","attachmentStorage":"content-addressed","activeDocument":{"type":"part","key":"cm_mv287zmd"}},"attachments":[]}